Z||000000||DR650SE||10-26-2001||01:25 AM||||The other day I sat in my drive wa and reved that hearty pushrod engine and dumped the clutch.  Then With my clutch foot I hit the brakes and had the gas down hard.  I sat there while the tires smoked till it filled the interior.  God I love that smell!  It was lots of fun and I have pictures, but not on the computer.  Anyone do this?  It's soo fun.  I have 2 86 SE's V6 4SPD (both black) (twins named Maverick and Goose--I love Topgun)||||reg||12
