Z||000006||jelly2m8||10-26-2001||04:13 PM||||Ya we have a bunch of guys around here like that. No offense DR650SE, but how do you call this fun?<P> First ,you are abusing your car. Do these people have a free supply of parts, or what? Tires, clutches, engine/tranny mounts, transaxles just to name of a few of the parts getting abused.<BR> <BR>Second your drive way now looks like hell.<P> lastly, someday you will be in here asking " how comes that broke?.....stupid fiero......."<P> Oh ya, nothin like the smell or burnt rubber, I bet the chicks are really attrached to that smell.....<P> Gee, you think that was impressive, I seen guys with 3 cylinder Geo's lite-em up.||||reg||1
